                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi></head>
                <p>The Cabinet Committee on Germany met with Roosevelt on September 9, 1944, and
                    discussed the postwar treatment of Germany. No official minutes of the meeting
                    have been found, but for information on the meeting based on Morgenthau material
                    see Blum, pp. 367–368, and <hi rendition="#italic">Morgenthau Diary</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Germany</hi>), vol. I, pp. 608–611.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
